- Round 8: Good (weight $\\lambda^3 \\approx 0.512$)\n- Round 7: Bad (weight $\\lambda^4 \\approx 0.4096$)\n- Round 6: Good (weight $\\lambda^5 \\approx 0.32768$)\n- Round 5: Good (weight $\\lambda^6 \\approx 0.262144$)\n- Round 4: Good (weight $\\lambda^7 \\approx 0.2097152$)\n- Round 3: Good (weight $\\lambda^8 \\approx 0.16777216$)\n- Round 2: Good (weight $\\lambda^9 \\approx 0.134217728$)\n- Round 1: Good (weight $\\lambda^{10} \\approx 0.1073741824$)\n\nSum of weights of good interactions after Round 11 ($P_{11}$):\n$P_{11} = 1 + 0.512 + 0.32768 + 0.262144 + 0.2097152 + 0.16777216 + 0.134217728 + 0.1073741824 = 2.72090326$\nSum of weights of bad interactions after Round 11 ($N_{11}$):\n$N_{11} = 0.8 + 0.64 + 0.4096 = 1.8496$\n\n**2. Calculating for $n$ future good interactions:**\nAfter $n$ additional good interactions, the total weight of the history is scaled by $\\lambda^n$.\n$P_n = \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} \\lambda^i + P_{11} \\cdot \\lambda^n = \\frac{1-\\lambda^n}{1-\\lambda} + P_{11} \\cdot \\lambda^n$\n$N_n = N_{11} \\cdot \\lambda^n$\n\nThe posterior mean is:\n$E[\\theta] = \\frac{P_n + 1}{P_n + N_n + 2}$\n\nWe want $E[\\theta] \\ge 0.75 \\implies \\frac{P_n + 1}{P_n + N_n + 2} \\ge 0.75$\n$P_n + 1 \\ge 0.75(P_n + N_n + 2)$\n$0.25 P_n - 0.75 N_n - 0.5 \\ge 0$\n$P_n - 3 N_n - 2 \\ge 0$\n\nSubstitute $P_n$ and $N_n$:\n$\\frac{1-\\lambda^n}{0.2} + P_{11} \\lambda^n - 3 N_{11} \\lambda^n - 2 \\ge 0$\n$5(1-\\lambda^n) + (P_{11} - 3 N_{11})\\lambda^n - 2 \\ge 0$\n$5 - 5\\lambda^n + (2.7209 - 3(1.8496))\\lambda^n - 2 \\ge 0$\n$3 + (2.7209 - 5.5488 - 5)\\lambda^n \\ge 0$\n$3 - 7.8279 \\lambda^n \\ge 0$\n$\\lambda^n \\le \\frac{3}{7.8279} \\approx 0.3832$\n\nWith $\\lambda = 0.8$:\n$n \\cdot \\log(0.8) \\le \\log(0.3832)$\n$n \\ge \\frac{\\log(0.3832)}{\\log(0.8)} \\approx \\frac{-0.9592}{-0.2231} \\approx 4.30$\n\nChecking $n=5$:\n$P_5 = \\frac{1-0.8^5}{0.2} + 2.7209(0.8^5) = 3.3616 + 1.1144 = 4.4760$\n$N_5 = 1.8496(0.8^5) = 0.7582$\n$E[\\theta] = \\frac{5.4760}{4.4760 + 0.7582 + 2} = \\frac{5.4760}{7.2342} \\approx 0.7569$ (This is $\\ge 0.75$)\n\nChecking $n=4$:\n$P_4 = \\frac{1-0.8^4}{0.2} + 2.7209(0.8^4) = 2.952 + 1.393 = 4.345$\n$N_4 = 1.8496(0.8^4) = 0.952$\n$E[\\theta] = \\frac{5.345}{4.345 + 0.952 + 2} = \\frac{5.345}{7.297} \\approx 0.7324$ (This is $< 0.75$)\n\nThe minimum number of interactions is 5.\n\n5","reasoning":null,"score":1,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"5","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*)(?:\\.0+(?!\\d))?"},"timing":{"wall_sec":53.448,"prompt_tokens":476,"generation_tokens":1390,"ttft_ms":912,"prefill_ms":912,"decode_ms":52535,"source":"client","cached_prompt_tokens":0}},{"item_id":"arm_amort_new_payment","prompt_name":"arm_amort_new_payment","family":"arm_amort","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"535.70","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"213.32","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*(?:\\.\\d+)?)","nearMisses":[{"slip":"truncated","credit":0.5,"expected":"213.31"}]},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.762,"prompt_tokens":228,"generation_tokens":6,"ttft_ms":647,"prefill_ms":647,"decode_ms":114,"source":"client","cached_prompt_tokens":0}},{"item_id":"arm_amort_new_payment_s1","prompt_name":"arm_amort_new_payment_s1","family":"arm_amort","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"766.33","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"455.47","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*(?:\\.\\d+)?)"},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.736,"prompt_tokens":229,"generation_tokens":6,"ttft_ms":621,"prefill_ms":621,"decode_ms":114,"source":"client","cached_prompt_tokens":0}},{"item_id":"arm_amort_chain#1","prompt_name":"arm_amort_chain#1","family":"arm_amort","parent_item_id":"arm_amort_chain","turn":1,"prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"377.42","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"374.88","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*(?:\\.\\d+)?)","nearMisses":[{"slip":"truncated","credit":0.5,"expected":"374.87"}]},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.741,"prompt_to